# The demo database. Regenerate with:
#   python -m p3_api.cli seed data/mock_findings.raw.json
# Committed findings would hide a broken ingest path behind stale data.
# docs/INTEGRATION_CONTRACT.md is generated too, but stays committed --
# `scripts/generate_contract_doc.py --check` is what keeps it honest.
